  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>에 반응해서\n일부 기계의 전원이 켜졌다...!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000C5D00020BC18C751D574C11C000AC77CBD800020AE30ACC4C7580020C804C6D0C7740020CF1CC84CB2E4002E002E002E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보안 확인 중...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n대응하는 메가스톤을 확인...\n일부 시스템을 재기동합니다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C5480020D655C7780020C911002E002E002E00100001BE01000AB300C751D558B2940020BA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7440020D655C778002E002E002E000AC77CBD800020C2DCC2A4D15CC7440020C7ACAE30B3D9D569B2C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "프로젝트 M 기동.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n고위험 프로젝트입니다.\n잠금을 해제하겠습니까?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D504B85CC81DD2B80020004D0020AE30B3D9002E00100001BE01000AACE0C704D5D80020D504B85CC81DD2B8C785B2C8B2E4002E000AC7A0AE08C7440020D574C81CD558ACA0C2B5B2C8AE4C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "해제한다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D574C81CD55CB2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그만둔다",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9CCB454B2E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>,\n너 지금 뭐 하고 있는 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C000AB1080020C9C0AE080020BB500020D558ACE00020C788B2940020AC70C57C003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뮤츠 같은 위험한 포켓몬과 대치하다니.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBA4CE200020AC19C7400020C704D5D8D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACACFC0020B300CE58D558B2E4B2C8002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 일이 있어도 포획해야 해!\n알았어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C788C5B4B3C40020D3ECD68DD574C57C0020D5740021000AC54CC558C5B4003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뮤츠는\n무슨 일이 있어도 포획해야 해!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBA4CE20B294000ABB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C788C5B4B3C40020D3ECD68DD574C57C0020D574002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뮤~!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBA4007E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뮤츠는 무슨 일이 있어도 포획해야 한다니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBA4CE20B2940020BB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C788C5B4B3C40020D3ECD68DD574C57C0020D55CB2E4B2C8AE4C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 강한 건 잘 알겠지만,\n쓰러뜨려 버리면 안 되지!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n뮤츠는 무슨 일이 있어도 포획해야 한다니까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020AC15D55C0020AC740020C7980020C54CACA0C9C0B9CC002C000AC4F0B7ECB728B8240020BC84B9ACBA740020C5480020B418C9C0002100100001BE00000ABBA4CE20B2940020BB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C788C5B4B3C40020D3ECD68DD574C57C0020D55CB2E4B2C8AE4C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포획에 성공한 모양이네.\n잠깐 기다리고 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECD68DC5D00020C131ACF5D55C0020BAA8C591C774B124002E000AC7A0AE500020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기는 볼 때마다\n뭐라고 말하기 힘든 기분이 드네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30B2940020BCFC0020B54CB9C8B2E4000ABB50B77CACE00020B9D0D558AE300020D798B4E00020AE30BD84C7740020B4DCB124002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "음성 통화만으로는 심심하니까\n홀로그램으로 연락해 봤어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C74CC1310020D1B5D654B9CCC73CB85CB2940020C2ECC2ECD558B2C8AE4C000AD640B85CADF8B7A8C73CB85C0020C5F0B77DD5740020BD24C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 어째서 플라드리 래버러토리에서\n뮤츠와 싸우게 된 건지 설명해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020C5B4C9F8C11C0020D50CB77CB4DCB9AC0020B798BC84B7ECD1A0B9ACC5D0C11C000ABBA4CE20C6400020C2F8C6B0AC8C0020B41C0020AC74C9C00020C124BA85D5740020C904AC8C002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드릴게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "혹시 심심하세요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D639C2DC0020C2ECC2ECD558C138C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래, 사람이 싹싹한 맛이 있어야지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798002C0020C0ACB78CC7740020C2F9C2F9D55C0020B9DBC7740020C788C5B4C57CC9C0002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이레귤러한 답변이지만\n무시하고 설명해 주겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B808ADE4B7ECD55C0020B2F5BCC0C774C9C0B9CC000ABB34C2DCD558ACE00020C124BA85D5740020C8FCACA0C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뮤츠는 포켓몬의\n유전자에 대해 연구하던<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n과학자에 의해 태어난 포켓몬이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBA4CE20B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC758000AC720C804C790C5D00020B300D5740020C5F0AD6CD558B35800100001BE00000AACFCD559C790C5D00020C758D5740020D0DCC5B4B09C0020D3ECCF13BAACC774C57C002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강한 에너지를 품고 있는 존재여서\n최종병기에 이용할 수 있을지<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n플레어단에서도 주목하고 있었지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D55C0020C5D0B108C9C0B97C0020D488ACE00020C788B2940020C874C7ACC5ECC11C000ACD5CC885BCD1AE30C5D00020C774C6A9D5600020C2180020C788C744C9C000100001BE00000AD50CB808C5B4B2E8C5D0C11CB3C40020C8FCBAA9D558ACE00020C788C5C8C9C0002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러던 중, 칼로스지방의 이름없는 동굴에\n뮤츠가 출현했다는 정보를 얻은 플레어단은<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n뮤츠를 확보하는 데 성공했어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB3580020C911002C0020CE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C7580020C774B984C5C6B2940020B3D9AD74C5D0000ABBA4CE20AC000020CD9CD604D588B2E4B2940020C815BCF4B97C0020C5BBC7400020D50CB808C5B4B2E8C74000100001BE00000ABBA4CE20B97C0020D655BCF4D558B2940020B3700020C131ACF5D588C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어째서 뮤츠가 칼로스지방에 출현했는지는\n여전히 불명이지만 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11C0020BBA4CE20AC000020CE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C5D00020CD9CD604D588B294C9C0B294000AC5ECC804D7880020BD88BA85C774C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화의 능력을 얻기 위해\n찾아왔을 가능성도 일부에서 제기됐지만<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n플레어단의 과학자 다섯이 힘을 합쳐도\n뮤츠의 비밀을 밝혀내지는 못했어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뮤츠나이트X와 뮤츠나이트Y\n두 메가스톤을 모두 사용해 봤지만<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n뮤츠를 메가진화시키지 못했거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBA4CE20B098C774D2B80058C6400020BBA4CE20B098C774D2B80059000AB4500020BA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7440020BAA8B4500020C0ACC6A9D5740020BD24C9C0B9CC00100001BE00000ABBA4CE20B97C0020BA54AC00C9C4D654C2DCD0A4C9C00020BABBD588AC70B4E0002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뮤츠도 평소에는 싸울 에너지를\n비축하기 위해 움직이지 않았고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBA4CE20B3C40020D3C9C18CC5D0B2940020C2F8C6B80020C5D0B108C9C0B97C000ABE44CD95D558AE300020C704D5740020C6C0C9C1C774C9C00020C54AC558ACE0002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇게 프로젝트 M은\n그대로 동결 상태가 되어 버렸지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AC8C0020D504B85CC81DD2B80020004DC740000AADF8B300B85C0020B3D9ACB00020C0C1D0DCAC000020B418C5B40020BC84B838C9C0002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고, 어째서 이번에\n뮤츠가 반응한 건지 정말 의문이네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE0002C0020C5B4C9F8C11C0020C774BC88C5D0000ABBA4CE20AC000020BC18C751D55C0020AC74C9C00020C815B9D00020C758BB38C774B124002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 가지고 있는\n뮤츠나이트X와 뮤츠나이트Y에<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n반응한 걸지도 모르겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788B294000ABBA4CE20B098C774D2B80058C6400020BBA4CE20B098C774D2B80059C5D000100001BE00000ABC18C751D55C0020AC78C9C0B3C40020BAA8B974ACA0C5B4002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇다면 이번에는\n어째서 네가 두 메가스톤을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n가지고 있는지가 신경 쓰이는걸?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807B2E4BA740020C774BC88C5D0B294000AC5B4C9F8C11C0020B124AC000020B4500020BA54AC00C2A4D1A4C74400100001BE00000AAC00C9C0ACE00020C788B294C9C0AC000020C2E0ACBD0020C4F0C774B294AC78003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 아무래도 상관없나?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020C544BB34B798B3C40020C0C1AD00C5C6B098003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너 정도 실력의 트레이너라면\n뮤츠도 말을 잘 따를 테니까.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B1080020C815B3C40020C2E4B825C7580020D2B8B808C774B108B77CBA74000ABBA4CE20B3C40020B9D0C7440020C7980020B530B97C0020D14CB2C8AE4C002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 소장 대리도 나름 바쁜 몸이니까\n이만 끊을게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
